AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004357> "Genes: In limb buds of chick and mouse, Shh expression is activated as soon as there is a morphological bud, whereas in S. canicula fin buds, consistent with reported data in other cartilaginous fishes, Shh is transcribed late in fin development[PMID:17187056]")
