# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004876> (urogenital fold)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "MP:0011835") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "MP:anna") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Wikipedia:Urogenital_folds") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0004876> "One of of the pair of folds derived from the cloacal folds which give rise to a portion of the external genitalia; in male embryos they close over the urethral plate and fuse to form the spongy (penile) urethra and ventral aspect of the penis, not including the glans; failure of fusion of the urethral folds leads to hypospadias; in female embryos they fuse only anterior to the anus and form the labia minora[MP].")
